{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51402","headline":"夏日过从叔幽居 · 施肩吾","name":"夏日过从叔幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"且将一叶系垂阳，角对清溪夏日长。\n林下喜逢青竹卷，局边输却紫罗囊。\n碧蹄骏马衔刍细，红粉佳人挈榼香。\n伯仲历官年尽少，那知不笑汉冯唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}